  "brain_first": "“能不能被客观核对？还是表达了评价、判断、建议？”",
  "sort_order": 1029,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1282
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题目要求区分 fact, opinion, claim, evidence，或",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1283
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "判断哪句是作者评价。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1284
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1285
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Fact 可核验；opinion 含评价或价值判断。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1286
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “能不能被客观核对？还是表达了评价、判断、建议？”",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1287
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 阅读中观点和事实常交织，识别它们有助于态度、论证和推断题。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1288
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1289
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看句子有没有数据、时间、可观察事实。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1290
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 看评价词：best, harmful, meaningful, should, surprisingly。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1291
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 如果是研究结论，注意它仍是“研究发现/主张”，不等于永恒事实。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1292
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 区分“作者观点”和“被引用观点”。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1293
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1294
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1295
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1296
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 数字不自动等于可靠事实，但通常属于证据表达",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1297
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· should / better / valuable 多为观点",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1298
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· X reported that... → 这是“X的说法”，主体要保留",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1299
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 你能指出句子是可核验事实还是评价/判断。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1300
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 遇到看似客观的概括，检查有没有强度词和价值词。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1301
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1302
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The park opened in 2018. 是事实；It is the city's most inspiring public space. 是评价。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1303
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1304
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把所有研究结论当绝对事实。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1305
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略观点主体。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1306
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1307
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 可客观核验吗？",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1308
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 谁在做评价？",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1309
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1310
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1311
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1312
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 事实可核，观点会评。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1313
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1315
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “The city has 2 million residents.”事实还是观点？",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1316
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. “It is the most beautiful city.”",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1317
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. “Researchers found...”若有来源，属于？",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1318
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 作者说“surprisingly useful”中的surprisingly？",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1319
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 区分事实观点看什么？",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1320
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. fact；2. opinion；3. reported factual claim/evidence；4. 带评价色彩。；5. 能否客观核验 vs 主观",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1321
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "评价/判断。",
      "sourcePage": 47,
      "sourceIndex": 1322
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R15 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R15”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1323
    }
  ],
